  "description": "Scout – The Ultimate Family Tandem for All Adventures\nThe Scout Tandem is designed with family-friendly PeriScope technology, offering incredible value and versatility for all types of riders. Perfect for your next family adventure, the Scout is engineered for easy and quick adjustments, ensuring a comfortable fit for riders of all sizes—from kids to adults. With 26” wheels and wider tires, this tandem delivers superior stability and a lower standover height, making it an excellent choice for smaller riders and those just starting out on tandem cycling.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 26” wheels with 30-40mm tires for a smooth, stable ride\n\nCo-Motion zonally-butted chromoly tubing for a durable and responsive frame\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for steady handling\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for an enjoyable ride over any terrain\n\nRack & fender mounts for added versatility and utility\n\nDual disc brakes for powerful and reliable stopping power\n\nShimano Deore components for smooth and efficient shifting\n\nHand-built touring wheels for strength and durability on long rides\n\nAvailable in two standard colors: Ferrari Red and Silver Metallic\n\nWhether you're tackling paved roads, and gravel paths, or exploring new destinations, the Scout Tandem delivers comfort, control, and adventure-ready performance for your whole family.\n\nComplete bike starting at $4,595.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion PeriScope Scout order started!",
